  "final": {
    "agentMessage": "**California DMV - Driver's License Renewal Online**\n\nFound via DMV homepage **\"How Can We Help? - Search a topic\"** searching for:\n\n> `renew driver's license online`\n\nResult page titled (partially hidden by Vote banner):\n\n> **... DRIVER'S LICENSE ONLINE**\n> **Service Advisor - renew driver's license online**\n\nStates:\n\n**Option 1 - Renew online to save time:**\n> `In most cases, Driver's License Renewals and ID Card Renewals are no longer processed at the DMV office and can be completed quickly and easily online.`\n\nWith a large blue button:\n> **Renew Online**\n\nThis is the starting point for the online renewal.\n\n**Option 2:** \n> `You may be eligible to renew by mail. Learn more.`\n\n**Option 3:**\n> `There are cases that require renewal in person, such as eligibility, restrictions, etc. In these cases, you may schedule an appointment to renew at the DMV office.`\n\n**Conclusion:** Yes - In most cases you **can** renew a California driver's license online, and you start from **Option 1 > Renew Online** button on the Service Advisor result for \"renew driver's license online\". If not eligible online, alternatives are by-mail or in-person appointment.\n\nNo personal information was entered - only used the site search to discover this information."
